<style>
  .panel-root {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 92px;
    background-color: #10151f;
    border-radius: 3.2px;
    border-width: 0.4px;
    border-color: #2a3550;
  }

  .panel-content {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8px;
    padding: 4.0px;
    background-color: #10151f;
    border-radius: 3.2px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #f5d90a;
    font-size: 2.7px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  }

  .heading {
    color: #fafaf7;
    font-size: 5.4px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .sub {
    color: #9aa4b8;
    font-size: 2.9px;
  }

  .stats {
    color: #e8ecf4;
    font-size: 3.4px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .gold {
    color: #ffd76a;
    font-size: 3.6px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .quest {
    color: #b9c4d8;
    font-size: 2.9px;
  }

  .feed {
    color: #8fb8d8;
    font-size: 2.7px;
  }

  .intro-wrap {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8px;
  }

  .story {
    color: #d8cfe0;
    font-size: 2.9px;
  }

  .hint {
    color: #8fb8d8;
    font-size: 2.5px;
  }

  .btn-begin {
    background-color: #2d4a35;
    border-color: #4a7a55;
  }

  .race-wrap {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4px;
  }

  .game-wrap {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1px;
  }

  .btn {
    background-color: #232b3d;
    border-radius: 2.2px;
    border-width: 0.2px;
    border-color: #3a4763;
    height: 8.1px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .chip {
    background-color: #232b3d;
    border-radius: 2.2px;
    border-width: 0.2px;
    border-color: #3a4763;
    height: 8.1px;
    flex-grow: 1;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    color: #e8ecf4;
    font-size: 2.9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .btn-label {
    font-size: 2.9px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .divider {
    height: 0.2px;
    background-color: #2a3550;
    margin-top: 0.9px;
    margin-bottom: 0.9px;
  }

  .row {
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 0.9px;
  }

  .edit-wrap {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9px;
  }

  .npc-wrap {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9px;
    background-color: #1a2233;
    border-radius: 2.2px;
    border-width: 0.2px;
    border-color: #4a5a80;
    padding-top: 1.4px;
    padding-bottom: 1.4px;
    padding-left: 1.4px;
    padding-right: 1.4px;
  }

  .xrb {
    margin-left: 4.0px;
    margin-right: 4.0px;
    margin-bottom: 3.2px;
    height: 9.0px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
<Panel class="panel-root">
  <div class="panel-content">
    <div class="eyebrow">ATLAS ETERNAL</div>
    <div class="heading">The Living Map</div>
    <div class="sub">Carry your champion. Dig the X. Rise to SSSS.</div>
    <div id="intro-wrap" class="intro-wrap">
      <div class="story">Long ago the world was folded into one living map. Its ink still moves - seas breathe, forests creep, mountains wake.</div>
      <div id="intro-map-story" class="story">You are the last Cartographer's heir. Carry your meeple across the tiles, dig where the red X burns, and climb from rank F to SSSS.</div>
      <div class="hint">HOW TO PLAY - pinch the blue meeple and drop it on a tile to travel beyond the edge of the map. Press glowing things. Accept quest cards for riches.</div>
      <Button id="btn-begin" class="btn btn-begin"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Begin the Crossing</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
    <div id="race-wrap" class="race-wrap" style="display: none">
      <div class="sub">Bind your soul - pick a race:</div>
      <Button id="btn-race-0" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Human</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-race-1" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Dwarf</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-race-2" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Elf</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-race-3" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Naga</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-race-4" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Demon</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
    <div id="game-wrap" class="game-wrap" style="display: none">
      <div id="stat-race" class="stats">-</div>
      <div id="stat-power" class="stats">Power 0</div>
      <div id="stat-gold" class="gold">0 gold</div>
      <div id="stat-gear" class="stats">No weapon wielded</div>
      <div id="stat-haven" class="sub">Haven: unbuilt</div>
      <div id="stat-map" class="sub">Map: the Wild Ink</div>
      <div id="stat-peers" class="sub">Table: solo</div>
      <div class="hint">Keys: E cartographer · M next map · B block · click the patron to deal</div>
      <div id="npc-wrap" class="npc-wrap" style="display: none">
        <div class="sub">GUILD PATRON</div>
        <div id="npc-name" class="stats">-</div>
        <div id="npc-offer" class="quest">-</div>
        <div id="npc-line" class="feed">-</div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="npc-take" class="chip">Take it</div>
          <div id="npc-bargain" class="chip">Bargain</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="npc-harder" class="chip">Harder!</div>
          <div id="npc-refuse" class="chip">Send away</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="npc-talk" class="chip">Talk (hold)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <Button id="btn-home" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Return to Haven</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-map" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Next Expedition</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-architect" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Commission the Guild</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-new" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">New Journey</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button id="btn-edit" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Cartographer Mode</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <div id="login-wrap" class="edit-wrap" style="display: none">
        <div class="sub">CARTOGRAPHER LOGIN - tap your key:</div>
        <div id="login-status" class="feed">First login claims a new key (4+ digits).</div>
        <div id="pin-display" class="stats">[    ]</div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="pin-1" class="chip">1</div>
          <div id="pin-2" class="chip">2</div>
          <div id="pin-3" class="chip">3</div>
          <div id="pin-4" class="chip">4</div>
          <div id="pin-5" class="chip">5</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="pin-6" class="chip">6</div>
          <div id="pin-7" class="chip">7</div>
          <div id="pin-8" class="chip">8</div>
          <div id="pin-9" class="chip">9</div>
          <div id="pin-0" class="chip">0</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="pin-back" class="chip">Back</div>
          <div id="pin-clear" class="chip">Clear</div>
          <div id="pin-enter" class="chip">Enter</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="edit-wrap" class="edit-wrap" style="display: none">
        <div class="sub">WORLD TOOLS - carry meeple, then stamp:</div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="tool-o" class="chip">Sea</div>
          <div id="tool-s" class="chip">Sand</div>
          <div id="tool-d" class="chip">Dsrt</div>
          <div id="tool-g" class="chip">Gras</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="tool-f" class="chip">Frst</div>
          <div id="tool-r" class="chip">Rock</div>
          <div id="tool-n" class="chip">Snow</div>
          <div id="tool-road" class="chip">Road</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="tool-dig" class="chip">Dig X</div>
          <div id="tool-haven" class="chip">Haven</div>
          <div id="tool-champ" class="chip">Spawn</div>
          <div id="tool-erase" class="chip">Erase</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="btn-brush-minus" class="chip">-</div>
          <div id="brush-label" class="sub">Brush 1</div>
          <Button id="btn-brush-plus" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">+</ButtonLabel></Button>
        </div>
        <div class="sub">BUILD BLOCKS - minecraft style:</div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="mat-d" class="chip">Dirt</div>
          <div id="mat-s" class="chip">Stone</div>
          <div id="mat-w" class="chip">Wood</div>
          <div id="mat-b" class="chip">Brick</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="mat-g" class="chip">Glass</div>
          <div id="mat-o" class="chip">Gold</div>
          <div id="mat-l" class="chip">Leaf</div>
          <div id="mat-label" class="sub">Stone</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="mat-c" class="chip">Concr</div>
          <div id="mat-m" class="chip">Marbl</div>
          <div id="mat-i" class="chip">Iron</div>
          <div id="mat-k" class="chip">Obsid</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="mat-a" class="chip">Water</div>
          <div id="mat-v" class="chip">Lava</div>
          <div id="mat-t" class="chip">Torch</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sub">PIECES - walls doors &amp; more:</div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="mat-W" class="chip">Wall</div>
          <div id="mat-D" class="chip">Door</div>
          <div id="mat-S" class="chip">Stair</div>
          <div id="mat-F" class="chip">Fence</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="mat-P" class="chip">Pane</div>
          <div id="mat-R" class="chip">Roof</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="btn-vox-add" class="chip">Place Block</div>
          <div id="btn-vox-del" class="chip">Break Block</div>
          <div id="btn-vox-clear" class="chip">Clear</div>
        </div>
        <Button id="btn-export" class="btn"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Export Map JSON</ButtonLabel></Button>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="btn-set-home" class="chip">Set as Home Map</div>
          <div id="btn-clear-home" class="chip">Reset Default</div>
        </div>
        <div id="home-status" class="feed">Your map becomes the world everyone lands in.</div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="btn-signout" class="chip">Sign out</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sub">AVATAR - your champion:</div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="char-c-0" class="chip">Az</div>
          <div id="char-c-1" class="chip">Em</div>
          <div id="char-c-2" class="chip">Vd</div>
          <div id="char-c-3" class="chip">Ro</div>
          <div id="char-c-4" class="chip">Cr</div>
          <div id="char-c-5" class="chip">Gd</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="hat-0" class="chip">Bare</div>
          <div id="hat-1" class="chip">Cap</div>
          <div id="hat-2" class="chip">Horns</div>
          <div id="hat-3" class="chip">Crown</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div id="back-0" class="chip">No back</div>
          <div id="back-1" class="chip">Cape</div>
          <div id="back-2" class="chip">Banner</div>
          <div id="back-3" class="chip">Wings</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="sub">QUEST RAIL</div>
      <div id="quest-0" class="quest"></div>
      <div id="quest-1" class="quest"></div>
      <div id="quest-2" class="quest"></div>
      <div id="quest-3" class="quest"></div>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div id="feed-0" class="feed"></div>
      <div id="feed-1" class="feed"></div>
      <div id="feed-2" class="feed"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Button id="xr-button" class="xrb"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Enter XR</ButtonLabel></Button>
  <Button id="exit-button" class="xrb" style="display: none"><ButtonLabel class="btn-label">Exit to Browser</ButtonLabel></Button>
</Panel>
